    TriggersEvent: 0
    CharacterMoodSprite: {fileID: 274264386, guid: b2aae9ff2a6c0ae49807513f7b7788f6, type: 3}
  - NodeGUID: 7b1e83e5-31c6-47f4-8513-6a091743d93a
    DialogueText: Aller, j'vais me bourrer la tronche maintenant, envoi moi ma bibine
